.TH AVR\-TESTS\-SEARCH 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-tests-search \- Search the tests recorded for a repository.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr tests search
[OPTIONS] [QUERY]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search the tests recorded for a repository.
.PP
Search the tests recorded for a repository, newest report first.
.PP
Each row is a test's latest recorded result across the repository's retained reports. QUERY matches a substring of the test name, suite or class, case-insensitively and literally. Repeat --status to match any selected outcome, for example --status failed --status errored. With --status, each row is the test's most recent result with a selected outcome, so a test that has passed since still appears.
.PP
The header reports how many reports were searched and their time range. Reports still being indexed or unavailable are counted, not hidden; a test absent from an incomplete search may still be recorded.
.PP
Read a row's failure message with avr tests JOB --status failed, and its earlier runs with avr tests history. Use --json '*' for test IDs, configuration digests and result IDs.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
[\fIQUERY\fR]
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Defaults to the configured organization.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (owner/name or rep-ID). Defaults to the current git repository.
.TP
\fB\-L\fR, \fB\-\-limit\fR \fIINTEGER RANGE\fR
Maximum tests to return; short pages are followed, up to 20 result pages. (default: 50)
.TP
\fB\-\-cursor\fR \fITEXT\fR
Continue from a previous response's next_cursor with the same query and filters.
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Show each test's most recent result with one of these outcomes (repeatable). A test that has passed since still appears. (choices: passed, failed, skipped, errored; repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-tests (1),
.BR avr-tests-history (1),
.BR avr-tests-list (1)
